{"id":45551,"date":"2025-10-05T08:28:36","date_gmt":"2025-10-05T07:28:36","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-de-londres-2026\/"},"modified":"2026-09-03T00:33:05","modified_gmt":"2026-09-02T23:33:05","slug":"maratona-de-londres","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-de-londres\/","title":{"rendered":"Maratona de Londres 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Maratona de Londres 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Maratona de Londres 2027<\/strong> (TCS London Marathon) \u00e9 a mais ic\u00f3nica, concorrida e solid\u00e1ria maratona do planeta, fazendo parte da elite das <strong>Abbott World Marathon Majors<\/strong> em <strong>Londres<\/strong>, no <strong>Reino Unido<\/strong>. Com mais de 800.000 inscri\u00e7\u00f5es no sorteio global e 50.000 participantes na linha de partida, a corrida \u00e9 aclamada pelo apoio ensurdecedor de quase 1 milh\u00e3o de pessoas ao longo das ruas.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com in\u00edcio nos relvados hist\u00f3ricos de <strong>Blackheath \/ Greenwich Park<\/strong>, o percurso plano de <strong>42,195 km<\/strong> passa pelo m\u00edtico navio Cutty Sark, cruza a grandiosa <strong>Tower Bridge<\/strong> na meia-maratona, serpenteia pelos arranha-c\u00e9us de Canary Wharf, percorre o Embankment junto ao Rio Tamisa e ao Big Ben, culminando na reta final da realeza em <strong>The Mall<\/strong>, em frente ao Pal\u00e1cio de Buckingham.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">25 de Abril de 2027 \u00e0s 09:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Blackheath (Partida) \/ The Mall (Meta), Londres, Reino Unido, Reino Unido<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Maratona (42.195 km)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">London Marathon Events \/ TCS \/ AbbottWMM<\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Maratona<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">TCS London Marathon<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 25 Abr \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:00 \u2022 Percurso Monumental Plano pelo Rio Tamisa<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Ballot Internacional:<\/strong> 146.00 \u00a3 GBP<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Fase de Sorteio Oficial)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data, hor\u00e1rio e local de partida da Maratona de Londres 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova realiza-se no domingo, 25 de abril de 2027, com partidas por vagas a partir das 09:00 em Greenwich Park \/ Blackheath e chegada em The Mall (Londres, Reino Unido).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como conseguir inscri\u00e7\u00e3o na Maratona de Londres?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O acesso principal para corredores internacionais realiza-se atrav\u00e9s do sorteio p\u00fablico anual (public ballot), operadores tur\u00edsticos oficiais (tour operators) ou vagas solid\u00e1rias de caridade (charity).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os monumentos mais marcantes do tra\u00e7ado londrino?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O percurso inclui o veleiro Cutty Sark em Greenwich, a travessia monumental da Tower Bridge, a Torre de Londres, a London Eye, as Casas do Parlamento \/ Big Ben e o Pal\u00e1cio de Buckingham.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui o kit de atleta?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Inclui dorsal oficial com chip eletr\u00f3nico, medalha finisher da Major, t-shirt comemorativa New Balance e transporte gratuito na rede de transportes de Londres (TfL) no dia da prova.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso consultar prazos e candidaturas ao sorteio (ballot)?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Todas as informa\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais est\u00e3o centralizadas no portal tcslondonmarathon.com, com cobertura em portugu\u00eas no Portugal Running.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Maratona de Londres 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-04-25\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Blackheath (Partida) \/ The Mall (Meta), Londres, Reino Unido\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Londres\", \"addressRegion\": \"Reino Unido\", \"addressCountry\": \"GB\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"London Marathon Events \/ TCS \/ AbbottWMM\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data, hor\u00e1rio e local de partida da Maratona de Londres 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova realiza-se no domingo, 25 de abril de 2027, com partidas por vagas a partir das 09:00 em Greenwich Park \/ Blackheath e chegada em The Mall (Londres, Reino Unido).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como conseguir inscri\u00e7\u00e3o na Maratona de Londres?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O acesso principal para corredores internacionais realiza-se atrav\u00e9s do sorteio p\u00fablico anual (public ballot), operadores tur\u00edsticos oficiais (tour operators) ou vagas solid\u00e1rias de caridade (charity).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os monumentos mais marcantes do tra\u00e7ado londrino?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O percurso inclui o veleiro Cutty Sark em Greenwich, a travessia monumental da Tower Bridge, a Torre de Londres, a London Eye, as Casas do Parlamento \/ Big Ben e o Pal\u00e1cio de Buckingham.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que inclui o kit de atleta?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Inclui dorsal oficial com chip eletr\u00f3nico, medalha finisher da Major, t-shirt comemorativa New Balance e transporte gratuito na rede de transportes de Londres (TfL) no dia da prova.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso consultar prazos e candidaturas ao sorteio (ballot)?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Todas as informa\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais est\u00e3o centralizadas no portal tcslondonmarathon.com, com cobertura em portugu\u00eas no Portugal Running.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":50793,"menu_order":0,"comment_statu